cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Semi-Supervised Distillation for Small-Sample Multimodal Cancer-Cell Classification"
abstract: >-
  An empirical study of pseudo-labeling and knowledge distillation for binary
  malignant/benign classification of paired bright-field + fluorescence microscopy
  cells on a small-sample, patient-disjoint benchmark. Soft-target distillation over
  the unlabeled test set is shown to dominate architectural and regularization changes;
  seven failure modes are diagnosed, and headline gains are scored against an
  empirically-measured seed-noise floor.
type: software
authors:
